  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ガラルちほうの　カリスマで　ある\nバンド「マキシマイザズ」の\nメンバー　ぜんいんに　よる　サイン。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "가라르지방의 카리스마 넘치는\n밴드 “맥시마이저즈”\n멤버 전원의 사인.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "伽勒爾地區神級樂團\n「馬西馬賽」全體成員的簽名。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une dédicace des membres du célèbre groupe de Galar,\n« The Maximizers », au grand complet.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Auf dieser Autogrammkarte haben alle Mitglieder der\nMaximizers unterschrieben. Die Band erfreut sich in der\nGalar-Region großer Beliebtheit.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un autógrafo firmado por todos los miembros de los\nMaximizers, el grupo musical más carismático de Galar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gli autografi di tutti i membri della banda\npiù carismatica di Galar, i “Maximizers”.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s signed by all members of the Galar region’s most\ncharismatic band, the Maximizers.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ガラル地方の　カリスマで　ある\nバンド「マキシマイザズ」の\nメンバー　全員に　よる　サイン。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "伽勒尔地区的标志性乐队\n“马西马赛”\n全体成员的亲笔签名。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un autógrafo firmado por todos los miembros de los\nMaximizers, el grupo musical más carismático de Galar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
